-- Karwasz cabinets for the production catalog (data-only, re-runnable).
--
-- Sources: the Karwasz 2022 catalog (outer dimensions, rails x modules, N/PE bars),
-- https://karwasz.com.pl/upfiles/katalogi/KATALOG%20-%202022-wersja%20skompresowana.pdf, and the price
-- list https://karwasz.com.pl/upfiles/Karwasz%20cennik%201.09.2026.xlsx, sheet "Cennik wyrobów
-- 28.08.2025".
--
-- Prices are net list prices in grosze, using the "Z" (patent-lock) price where the price list has no
-- plain variant. Geometry positions are not published by Karwasz: they are synthesised by the rules in
-- src/lib/karwasz-cabinets.ts.
--
-- This file is GENERATED by src/lib/karwasz-cabinets.test.ts - never hand-edit it. Once deployed it
-- must never be regenerated: a data fix (a price, a new model) is a new migration.
--
-- Keyed on the case-insensitive unique index, so re-running inserts nothing.
on conflict ((lower(manufacturer)), (lower(model))) do nothing;
